# Riverside Fairways — API credentials (TEMPLATE)
# Copy to `.env` and fill in real values. The real `.env` is gitignored.
# Hosting/domain logins captured at onboarding are in CREDENTIALS.local.md.
#
# ── WordPress ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AUTH: WordPress Application Password (wp-admin → Users → Profile →
# Application Passwords), against the admin user's USERNAME.
WP_SITE_URL=https://example.com
WP_API_URL=https://example.com/wp-json
WP_USER=admin-username
WP_APP_PASSWORD="xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx"

# ── GoHighLevel ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
